Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:39.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,和我不一样…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:42.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那美丽又柔顺的长发\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:45.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来闪闪发光…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:57.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 好久不见\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.68,0:01:02.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我美丽的黑天鹅啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:06.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真没想到您会为了我来到这里…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:10.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我心爱的白色羽翼\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.98,0:01:15.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 那娇艳的嘴唇\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:18.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那纤细的指尖\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.32,0:01:19.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还有\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.37,0:01:22.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那比夜色更美丽的黑发\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:25.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我为了见你一面远道而来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:27.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是不虚此行！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:29.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,您还是和以前一样会说话呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:31.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙是谁？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.30,0:01:33.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:35.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,亚纳戈的市长\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.30,0:01:36.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,市长？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:39.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他来干什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.47,0:01:41.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗妮卡大人的金主…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.31,0:01:46.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,重要的客人\n说无论如何都想见她\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:48.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,特地休假过来的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:53.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,先不说那些 我可是听说了哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:56.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,身为夜之女王的你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:01:59.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然在学别人当冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:00.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,夜之…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.45,0:02:01.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,女王？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:05.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要做那么危险的事情呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:07.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是缺钱的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:08.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:10.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢您的关心 市长先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:15.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但是在我店铺休息的顾客们\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:17.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也有很多是冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.09,0:02:19.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,探寻着能让他们\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.05,0:02:21.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,更好地得到治愈的方法…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.05,0:02:24.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不知不觉间 我的脚步\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:27.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就迈上了冒险的道路…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.93,0:02:28.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,女…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.64,0:02:31.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,女神啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:33.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你也太温柔了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.94,0:02:41.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗妮卡酱的温柔可真是\n让我浑身上下暖意融融啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.13,0:03:03.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:15.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第10话 理发和选择）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.25,0:04:17.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我在亚纳戈等着你啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:20.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗妮卡酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:24.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,您辛苦了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:26.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,塔妮娅你也辛苦了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:29.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗妮卡小姐\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:32.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要在这个村子里待到何时呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.68,0:04:36.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛 待太久也不好呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.11,0:04:39.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,惦记着我的客人也很多吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:40.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:43.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过没有问题\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:47.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,包括我在内 店里有很多\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:50.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被您拯救过的人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:53.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能够打理好店铺\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:55.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗妮卡小姐不必勉强\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.54,0:05:00.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是嫌我碍事想赶我走吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:03.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 那个…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:06.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我是希望您回来的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:10.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,骗你的啦！谢谢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:26.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:28.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,闪闪发光呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:33.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那大叔出手真大方啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:35.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想要的话我可以给你哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.71,0:05:36.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可用不着\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:41.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么做才能像大姐姐那样\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:43.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把男人玩弄于股掌之中呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.09,0:05:45.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.43,0:05:50.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等你变得和我一样有魅力\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:51.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露酱就也能够做到了哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:55.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也要变成有魅力的女人！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:58.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就首先像我一样\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:05:59.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把头发留长吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:03.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露酱的头发颜色这么漂亮\n不留长太可惜了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.19,0:06:05.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,头发是女人的生命\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:09.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有魅力的女人必须要有美丽的头发\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:14.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但是莉露是冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:16.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还是活动方便点好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:21.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,冒险者哪来那么多闲工夫打理头发\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.67,0:06:24.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是嫌麻烦吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.42,0:06:27.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:28.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:29.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:31.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,头发变长了呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:33.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.01,0:06:36.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你剪剪吧 再长些就不好看了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:37.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:39.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,现在就剪吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:41.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正你也没事干吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:51.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剪什么发型好呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:55.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没回答吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:57.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我开玩笑的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:06:59.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,照平时的样子就行了吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:02.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我会认真给你剪的 放心\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:11.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我很熟练吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:13.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要莉露来帮忙啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:15.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我老实呆着\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:16.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,切…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:19.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露明明也能剪得很好的说\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.81,0:07:24.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说起来 和你认识也蛮久了呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.65,0:07:29.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真没想到\n你居然能成为白银级的冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:32.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,彼此彼此吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:33.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,夜之女王\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.33,0:07:44.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我啊 将来要成为夜之女王\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:46.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有一头闪闪发光的长发\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:49.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那我要成为超强的冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:52.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,每天吃得饱饱的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:08:00.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 没想到\n你连市长都能玩弄于股掌之中啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:04.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也没想到\n他居然会追到这种地方来呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:07.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是你在这里待太久啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:12.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快回去吧 回去吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:16.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,乱动的话会被我戳到哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:18.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,已经戳到了吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.95,0:08:20.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:28.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剪好啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:30.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,结束了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:31.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 辛苦你了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:34.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剪好了哦 阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:37.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 睡着了呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:41.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.39,0:08:44.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要不去散个步吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:46.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露酱也一起去吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.11,0:08:49.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露要等着阿始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.11,0:08:50.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:53.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,工具就由莉露来收拾吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:56.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,帮大忙了 那就拜托你啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:08:59.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,慢走\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.75,0:09:08.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也能把阿始打扮得很帅气！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.53,0:09:40.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,包括我在内 店里有很多\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:43.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被您拯救过的人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:57.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,该回去了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:10:01.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再说我头发太长了\n也不适合继续当冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:07.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！既然决定了\n就快点收拾行李吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:14.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么办呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:17.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 大叔们？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.65,0:10:19.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 维罗妮卡酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:20.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:23.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,仓库里跑出来一只蜘蛛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:24.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:27.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一只蜘蛛有什么好大惊小怪的？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.33,0:10:30.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我来把它赶走吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:32.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 虽说是蜘蛛没错…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.05,0:10:36.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:55.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:06.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰一下\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:08.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,东云先生在吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:11.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始还在睡觉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:13.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不要吵到他！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:14.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.09,0:11:16.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但有个紧急的委托…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.01,0:11:17.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我醒着哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:23.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 太好了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.51,0:11:24.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,东云先生！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.85,0:11:25.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:28.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗妮卡小姐被蜘蛛抓…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:34.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,您这是想改变一下形象吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.02,0:11:36.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:44.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,东云先生…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:45.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,变得光溜溜的了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:48.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:50.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 始先生…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:52.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是吓了一跳\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.25,0:11:55.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么啊 有什么好笑的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:10.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得觉得脑袋特别轻呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:13.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:15.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙去哪儿了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:18.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去散步了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:24.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗妮卡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.53,0:12:27.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大高跳蛛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:29.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在抓到猎物之后\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.70,0:12:32.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有先将猎物搁置一旁\n等其体力耗尽变弱的习性\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.83,0:12:35.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是从这个洞进来的吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:37.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姐姐…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:39.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我想维罗妮卡小姐\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:41.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要没受什么重伤\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:43.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,应该能够应付\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:44.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,都怪我\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:47.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沉迷于制作\n打起来很过瘾的怪兽排行榜\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:49.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没有注意到这一切…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.27,0:12:54.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 始先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:57.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们光顾着逃跑了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.81,0:13:00.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 这就是冒险者的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:01.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:06.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗妮卡小姐就拜托您了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.62,0:13:09.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好嘞\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:12.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但救回来之后我得揍她一顿\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:15.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧 莉露酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:18.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露没事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.35,0:13:33.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,果然…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:51.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛网的范围还挺广的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.99,0:13:53.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,连蚯蚓鼹鼠也很抗拒\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.95,0:13:56.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,得小心别被它们撞飞才行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:00.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们分头搜索吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:02.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那边就交给你们了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:03.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好嘞\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:05.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那么…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:08.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个笨蛋到底跑哪去了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:22.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,连鹿都被抓走当食物了啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:26.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,连这么大的生物都…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:29.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姐姐没事吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:31.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:38.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗妮卡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:40.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪儿！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.83,0:14:42.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在的话就回个话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:46.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被我找到的话就杀了你！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:50.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:52.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那么大声的话会把魔兽引来的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.02,0:14:59.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,失策失策\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:03.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是这样\n能把蜘蛛都引过来干掉的话…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:07.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个笨蛋也能稍微安全点了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.82,0:15:13.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,上了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真不愧是阿始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:27.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就算没了头发 阿始还是那么厉害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:28.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,烦死了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:32.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,蚯蚓鼹鼠！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.89,0:15:34.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:37.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事！快去找维罗妮卡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:45.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:50.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,交给我吧 阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:52.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露一定会找到她的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:07.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姐姐\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.21,0:16:10.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.30,0:16:14.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姐姐…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:16.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有谁在吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:20.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚的声音是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:29.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,声音是从这里传来的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:38.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姐姐\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:41.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露酱 你是来救我的吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:44.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯！一起回去吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.79,0:16:45.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别过来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:50.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我回不去了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:52.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:54.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:16:57.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经无法从这里离开了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:16:59.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.93,0:17:02.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.98,0:17:05.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露会想办法的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:07.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好痛！别拉我 莉露酱！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.77,0:17:11.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你受伤了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:13.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:18.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姐姐由莉露来保护！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.17,0:17:25.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:59.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,头发是女人的生命\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:03.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有魅力的女人必须要有美丽的头发\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:13.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我美丽的黑天鹅啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:18.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.65,0:18:36.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姐姐！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:44.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,危险\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.55,0:18:58.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:00.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一到关键时刻就这么靠不住…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:01.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个家伙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:18.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你说谁靠不住？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:23.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.49,0:19:25.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:33.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你那脑袋是怎么回事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:34.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你搞什么啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:36.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笑什么笑\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:37.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不就是你干的嘛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:38.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:40.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是认真给你剪过的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.55,0:19:41.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,少骗人了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:43.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我没骗你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:48.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露觉得阿始的这个发型\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.85,0:19:51.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很帅啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:07.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是你干的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.13,0:20:20.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:23.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为能让你变得更帅的嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.55,0:20:26.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 光头也挺适合你的嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:35.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你还笑！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:36.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧回去了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:45.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,您也很适合短发哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.62,0:20:46.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:48.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:49.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.95,0:20:52.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-请注意脚下\n-就算剃了光头也很帅啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.37,0:20:54.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露是这么觉得的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.29,0:20:55.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本没在反省吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.79,0:20:57.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我有在反省…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:20:59.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚不吃晚饭也可以…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:02.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那种事谁管你啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:08.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好漂亮的头发\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:12.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果能像那样漂亮\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:16.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果像那样能闪闪发光\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:17.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也能…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.77,0:21:21.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也能像那个人一样\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:25.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笑得那么幸福吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:28.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:31.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露可以把自己的头发给你\n来表示歉意…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:34.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谁要啊！真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.54,0:21:37.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙龙也可以\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:38.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,分一点毛给你的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:41.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还是算了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.46,0:21:45.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,做椅子的那个人也可以\n分点头发给阿始吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:46.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果维罗妮卡大人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:48.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,愿意为我剃发的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.80,0:21:50.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我很乐意！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:54.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:56.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剃头发的手艺真不错呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:22:00.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 反正我也把头发剪短了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:02.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来一段时间\n就继续在这边做冒险者吧 请多关照\n
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:04.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,给我回去啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:40.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下回 魅惑之力）\n
